@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 先登录；IDEA HTTP Client 默认保留会话 Cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "user-demo-hash"
}

> {%
client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.csrfToken);
client.global.set("userId", response.body.user.id);
%}

### 查看服务端会话身份
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 查询物品
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?page=0&size=10

### 查询个人订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trades?userId={{userId}}

### 查询统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/overview

### 退出登录，之后受保护接口应返回401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
